ne":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Every trial succeeds ideally with probability one; there is no postselection, overlap assumption or amplification. Arbitrary rotations still need coherent synthesis. Physical reset/discard/readout time and error correction are unavailable. For one fixed iid scalar mean, Hoeffding gives a separate shot count. Measuring the diagonal energy uses its full outcome range; simultaneous confidence for several reported means requires a new allocation.","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"Wzt23IDyRM"}],"key":"Set2kws4RE"}],"identifier":"14e4f189","html_id":"14e4f189","key":"B7CIsDV41d"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","data":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-14T10:58:10.798037Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-14T10:58:10.797890Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-14T10:58:10.820340Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-14T10:58:10.819622Z"}},"children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"purification = gibbs.decompose_gibbs(gibbs.diagonal_gibbs_purification(energies, beta))\nmixed = gibbs.decompose_gibbs(gibbs.build_gibbs_mixed_preparation(energies, beta))\ntrial = gibbs.decompose_gibbs(gibbs.build_gibbs_trial(energies, beta))\ndisplay(pd.DataFrame({\"purification\": dict(purification.count_ops()), \"retained mixed state\": dict(mixed.count_ops()), \"measured trial\": dict(trial.count_ops())}).fillna(0).astype(int))\nshots_z = gibbs.bounded_mean_shots(.03, .005)\nshots_energy = gibbs.bounded_mean_shots(.03, .005, energies.min(), energies.max())\nprint(f\"One Z0 mean: {shots_z} iid trials; one energy mean: {shots_energy} iid trials.\")\nprint(\"These are separate unexecuted statistical proposals; synthesis and physical faults are separate.\")","identifier":"simulation-gibbs-ledger-code","enumerator":"4","html_id":"simulation-gibbs-ledger-code","key":"seQnF9jo66"},{"type":"outputs","id":"_lXZVeykXTojJPL5uLfOb","children":[{"ty